    "Postulate 3", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "c51c3718-e3a8-4d6f-afec-4e997a25ec36"], Cell[
    "To draw a circle with any center and radius.", "TableText",
     ExpressionUUID->"e3b28517-3364-4da4-bda6-b2adab3ac2af"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "de70e3a9-dda2-49bf-8a6f-727fcd2fbd63"], Cell[
