     "b274c454-fda1-4f4f-a63d-61c8ea9a11f6"], Cell[
    "Circles are defined from congruence, not postulated.", "TableText",
     ExpressionUUID->"05d83cd7-ba30-42ad-bfef-4c4ae8f77f2c"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "ba6949b7-6b26-4286-9747-9c3b62e5ee5c"], Cell[
