    "Equidistance", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "2ed2da50-365f-4e0c-82c9-e628efd0bc95"], Cell["\<\
The locus of points equidistant from a centre, from the four-place congruence \
relation.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"d36361ba-ecf8-4a6f-a62f-dda7cc2e1ff2"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "f0685eb0-7acb-46d3-b122-73a754fbd8b6"], Cell[
    "Birkhoff", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "16742dec-15ad-4e0b-aa3c-96f403c479ff"], Cell[
    "Ruler postulate", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "92f2f9f2-4ace-4a6c-bfe8-6f84be56210f"], Cell[
    "The locus at fixed ruler distance from a point.", "TableText",
     ExpressionUUID->"48dda313-4113-4b6f-b979-c48e13fe363c"]}
  }]], "3ColumnTableMod",ExpressionUUID->"e5b07b26-2f50-4cd1-935b-\
ad7c3a535960"]
}, Open  ]],

